# Pratibha × Monad (web)

Follow `web/MONAD_ADOPTION.md` and `web/CLAUDE.md`.

- Prefer `src/components/ui/*` for chrome (Button, Input, Dialog, etc.); Base UI `render` prop, not `asChild`.
- Do **not** greenfield-rescaffold or wipe `globals.css` / product routes.
- Keep Pratibha tokens and sacred-script fonts; no IBM Plex / stock neutral as product face.
- Escalate before replacing: BrandMark, LayerBlock, YantraBreath, learn constellation/path visuals, lexicon flip/SRS, ArtImage.
- New UI: token classes or `var(--*)`; don't invent parallel button CSS.
- Verify Cloudflare/OpenNext still builds after Tailwind or shadcn changes.
